# Files the pre-commit hook may commit even when they are over 1 MiB. One shell glob per line (matched against the whole path; `*`
# also matches `/`). Lines starting with # and empty lines are ignored. Keep this list short: add a pattern in its own commit, with a reason.

# Screenshots and artwork of the documentation
docs/assets/*.png
docs/assets/*.jpg
docs/assets/*.jpeg
docs/assets/*.gif
docs/assets/*.webp
docs/assets/*.svg
docs/assets/*.ico
docs/assets/*.icns

# Fonts
*.ttf
*.otf
*.ttc
*.woff
*.woff2
